ve Cowork-created simulation after placing food on the floor and throwing a ball.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/nagi-home-cowork.webp","alt","Nagi the blue crab in a furnished three-dimensional home, with daily needs, food placement feedback and the ball activity.","https://tanuu5.github.io/nagi-home/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[87],"Claude Cowork","links","相关资源",[93],"resourceIds","section",{"_62":94,"_25":95},"Three.js","/zh/resources/threejs/","创作者开发记录",[99],"evidence",{"_62":100,"_25":101,"_102":103},"查看作者的 AI 使用说明","https://github.com/tanuu5/nagi-home#readme","note","README credits explicitly name Claude Cowork and Claude Opus 5.5, with human planning/publishing attribution.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[108],{"_62":109,"_25":110,"_102":111},"查看完整游戏项目","https://github.com/tanuu5/nagi-home","Complete single-file HTML with procedural Three.js scene, need/activity systems, dialogue and localStorage saves; MIT code. Three.js r169 is loaded from jsDelivr and fonts from Google Fonts, so a clean run requires those network resources. No coding-agent subscription is needed to play.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[117],{"_62":118,"_25":75,"_102":119},"试玩 Nagi Home","Japanese interface. Drag to orbit, wheel/pinch to zoom; the food and ball buttons trigger interactions. Normal food placement and ball throwing were checked in Chrome, including diary feedback. This is a life simulation without a combat or level-completion goal.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","disclosure","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[127],{"_62":128,"_25":101,"_102":-7},"查看作者的 Cowork 使用与模拟系统说明","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[133,134,135,136],"Place food or throw the ball, then watch Nagi’s activity and diary change.","Read the single index.html to follow daily needs, activity selection, Three.js models and localStorage persistence.","Serve the repository with a static HTTP server or open its HTML in a browser; Three.js and fonts are fetched from external CDNs.","Change one need or activity rule, then check its effect at normal and accelerated time speeds.","AI 工作流与开发背景","作者明确说明，代码由 Claude Cowork 中的 Claude Opus 5.5 生成，并另行注明人类负责企划与发布。这里保留实际客户端 Cowork，不将其改写为 Claude Code；作者没有公开完整对话。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","3D","track","metadata","引擎","Three.js r169 · JavaScript","engine","lead","3d","ai-assisted",[133,134,135,136],{"_62":167,"_25":101,"_17":123},{"_62":166,"_25":75,"_17":113,"_102":119},{"_62":163,"_25":110,"_164":165,"_102":111},{"_62":162,"_25":101,"_102":103},[161],"threejs","Read the creator’s AI attribution","Open the complete game project","scope","complete-project","Play Nagi Home","Read the creator’s Cowork and simulation notes",{"_169":170},"documents",{"_67":171,"_35":172},[174,178,179,180,177,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,176,213,175,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231],[173,174,175,176,177],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model